  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together Malai Yogurt, Brazilian Spice Blend, Salt, and Black Pepper.",
    "Add sliced Red Onion, Red Bell Pepper, and Zucchini to the bowl. Mix well to coat.",
    "Soak Skewers in water for 30 minutes. Thread marinated vegetables onto the skewers.",
    "Brush Skewers with Olive Oil and season with Salt and Black Pepper.",
    "Place Skewers on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper. Roast in the oven for 15-20 minutes, or until the vegetables are tender and lightly charred.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with fresh cilantro if desired."
